      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_14.2/p@173426",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOMERSET.\nAh, Warwick, Warwick, wert thou as we are,\nWe might recover all our loss again.\nThe Queen from France hath brought a puissant power;\nEven now we heard the news. Ah, couldst thou fly!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
